        <IfcPropertySetTemplate GlobalId="073rA0qSOHuO00025QrE$V" Name="Pset_BuildingUseAdjacent" ApplicableEntity="IfcBuilding">
          <Description>Provides information on adjacent buildings and their uses to enable their impact on the building of interest to be determined. Note that for each instance of the property set used, where there is an existence of risk, there will be an instance of the property set Pset_Risk (q.v).</Description>
