            </IfcPropertyTemplate>
            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="2blg80qWmHuO00025QrE$V" Name="AirConditioningCentral" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcBoolean" SecondaryMeasureType="" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Indication whether the space  requires a central air conditioning provided (TRUE) or not (FALSE).
It should only be given, if the property "AirConditioning" is set to TRUE.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
