              <Description>Indication whether this object is designed to serve as an exit in the case of fire (TRUE) or not (FALSE).
Here it defines an exit stair in accordance to the national building code.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2lz2CtEHbD3e8llJHOO93h">
