              <Description>Reference ID for this specific instance of a distribution system, or sub-system (e.g. 'WWS/VS1', which indicates the system to be WWS, subsystems VSI/400). The reference values depend on the local code of practice.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0CYMYJ$292IuwT1N$IBsLB">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Reference" Language="en" />
