            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="2gW5sT9PzCeeM2vqNjkQLQ" Name="ElectricalSystemCategory" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Designates the voltage range of the circuit, according to IEC.  HIGHVOLTAGE indicates &gt;1000V AC or &gt;1500V DV; LOWVOLTAGE indicates 50-1000V AC or 120-1500V DC; EXTRALOWVOLTAGE indicates &lt;50V AC or &lt;120V DC.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2aQIE1yID87xq_B20xNhay">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Electrical System Category" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="3yLVl1bObE8fTQXPnU0j7O">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="電気システムのカテゴリー" Language="ja-JP">
                    <Description>IECに準拠した回路の電圧レンジを示す。次の列挙型の値を取る。(HIGHVOLTAGE indicates &gt;1000V AC or &gt;1500V DV; LOWVOLTAGE indicates 50-1000V AC or 120-1500V DC; EXTRALOWVOLTAGE indicates &lt;50V AC or &lt;120V DC.)</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0W1R7twQD6ow46DJ9kT0ia">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="전기 시스템 카테고리" Language="ko-KR">
                    <Description>IEC에 따른 회로의 전압 범위를 나타낸다. 다음 열거 형의 값을 받는다. (HIGHVOLTAGE indicates&gt; 1000V AC or&gt; 1500V DV; LOWVOLTAGE indicates 50-1000V AC or 120-1500V DC; EXTRALOWVOLTAGE indicates &lt;50V AC or &lt;120V DC)</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1LhnpZAGX8_x4GiJbgaDZq">
                  <RelatingLibrary Identification="HIGHVOLTAGE" Name="High Voltage" Language="en" />
