              <Description>Total energy added or removed from air that affects its temperature.  If a value is less than zero (negative), then the thermal load is lost from the space. If a value is greater than zero (positive), then the thermal load is a gain to the space.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0ABe02vgX0BhJ6V3vtRanI">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Total Sensible Load" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0moH5R0U14duSRlPaE9q2R">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="顕熱負荷の合計" Language="ja-JP">
                    <Description>空気温度を上昇・下降させる取得・損失の熱量の合計。ゼロより小さい（－）場合、室内が熱損失となる。ゼロより大きい（＋）場合、室内が熱取得となる。</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1rD$7rFln6$gZIEx4UUaO9">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="현열부하의 합계" Language="ko-KR">
                    <Description>공기 온도를 상승 · 하강하는 취득 · 손실 열량의 총. 제로보다 작은 (-) 경우 실내가 열 손실이된다. 제로보다 큰 (+) 경우 실내가 열을 검색된다.</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
              </HasAssociations>
              <TemplateType>P_BOUNDEDVALUE</TemplateType>
            </IfcPropertyTemplate>
            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="3U4R20qWiHuO00025QrE$V" Name="TotalLatentLoad" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcPowerMeasure" SecondaryMeasureType="" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Total energy added or removed from air that affects its humidity or concentration of water vapor.  If a value is less than zero (negative), then the thermal load is lost from the space. If a value is greater than zero (positive), then the thermal load is a gain to the space.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1m$sgvJnvCfQlTOSYu6PnV">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Total Latent Load" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2kcbBDqAD6b8zGHxpkCROI">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="潜熱負荷の合計" Language="ja-JP">
                    <Description>空気湿度（水蒸気量）を上昇・下降させる取得・損失の熱量の合計。ゼロより小さい（－）場合、室内の水蒸気が減少となる。ゼロより大きい（＋）場合、室内の水蒸気が増大となる。</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
