          <Description>Defines properties of individual instances of manufactured products that may be given by the manufacturer.
HISTORY: IFC 2x4: AssemblyPlace property added. This property does not need to be asserted if Pset_ManufacturerTypeInformation is allocated to the type and the AssemblyPlace property is asserted there.</Description>
