            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="2TmIBb79f7dw0zAPwYFtGE" Name="MaintenaceType" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Identifies the predefined types of maintenance that can be done from which the type that generates the maintenance work order may be set where:

ConditionBased: generated as a result of the condition of an asset or artefact being less than a determined value.
Corrective: generated as a result of an immediate and urgent need for maintenance action.
PlannedCorrective: generated as a result of immediate corrective action being needed but with sufficient time available for the work order to be included in maintenance planning.
Scheduled: generated as a result of a fixed, periodic maintenance requirement.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2tZoN8bk1399yGzU50uvwq">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Maintenace Type" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1BRvbdTAn8ohBtu3gHv1mD">
                  <RelatingLibrary Identification="CONDITIONBASED" Name="Condition Based" Language="en" />
