              <Description>Applying ground fault function. A flag indicating that the ground fault function of the device is used. The value should be set to FALSE for devices not having a ground fault function, or if the ground fault function is not selected to be used.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="3DrNN_UUb1mRvOWgkrqtq9">
