              <Description>The time limit in [s] limiting the application of CurrentTolerance1, if any. If the value is set to 0, the value of the CurrentTolerance1 is valid for the whole time/current-curve.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1f5wZDc1vB$vthyxYjM6kl">
