              <Description>A list of current adjustment values that may be applied to a tripping unit for an AdjustmentValueType = LIST. A minimum of 1 and a maximum of 16 adjustment values may be specified. Note that this property should not have a value for an  AdjustmentValueType = RANGE.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1PL9fX33f8W9k$8E7imZ1C">
