            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="0tmYKmyNb6$8ytot5S2z_v" Name="DischargeDirection" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Discharge direction of the air terminal.

Parallel: discharges parallel to mounting surface designed so that flow attaches to the surface.
Perpendicular:  discharges away from mounting surface.
Adjustable: both parallel and perpendicular discharge.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="3X451jE6P3jP6X6VsMs6CW">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Discharge Direction" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2TXeFzSELE4hvExV58gdB3">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="DirectionEmission" Language="fr-FR">
                    <Description>Direction d'émission du terminal de ventilation.

Parallèle: émission parallèle à la surface de fixation conçu de façon à ce que le flux se colle à la surface.
Perpendiculaire: émission s'éloignant de la surface de fixation.
Réglable: émission parallèle et aussi s'éloignant de la surface de fixation.</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0fQmcoo$b5vOootywIoEwL">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="吐き出し方向" Language="ja-JP">
                    <Description>ターミナルの吐き出し方向
水平：取り付け面と水平に吐き出し
垂直：取り付け面から離れた方向に吐き出し
調節可能：水平・垂直方向両方に調整</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2YIBYp8Dv1uuxxch5W90vs">
                  <RelatingLibrary Identification="PARALLEL" Name="Parallel" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1iu2YNQ6T4tgVLU1WSsQn1">
