            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="1T7g2ShtD3wf6G6BgNrcTR" Name="MountingType" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>The way the air terminal is mounted to the ceiling, wall, etc.

Surface: mounted to the surface of something (e.g., wall, duct, etc.).
Flat flush: mounted flat and flush with a surface.
Lay-in: mounted in a lay-in type ceiling (e.g., a dropped ceiling grid).</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0IG35peuj5R9syD7tyxe3P">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Mounting Type" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
