            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="15ddALTuLBjRoXyTKEjSHm" Name="CircuitType" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>OpenCircuit: Exposes water directly to the cooling atmosphere.
CloseCircuit: The fluid is separated from the atmosphere by a heat exchanger.
Wet: The air stream or the heat exchange surface is evaporatively cooled.
