              <Description>Leakage per unit length curve versus working pressure. If a scalar is expressed then it represents LeakageClass which is flowrate per unit area at a specified pressure rating (e.g., ASHRAE Fundamentals 2001 34.16.).</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
