        <IfcPropertySetTemplate GlobalId="2uEjg0qX0HuO00025QrE$V" Name="Pset_TankTypeSectional" ApplicableEntity="IfcTank/SECTIONAL">
          <Description>Fixed vessel constructed from sectional parts with one or more compartments for storing a liquid.

Note (1): All sectional construction tanks are considered to be rectangular by default.
Note (2): Generally, it is not expected that sectional construction tanks will be used for the purposes of gas storage.

Pset renamed from Pset_TankTypeSectionalTank to Pset_TankTypeSectional in IFC2x2 Pset Addendum.</Description>
          <HasAssociations>
            <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1qxFv27MfBJQcHce6$MJsh">
