        <IfcPropertySetTemplate GlobalId="0E4O60qXKHuO00025QrE$V" Name="Pset_ValveTypeIsolating" ApplicableEntity="IfcValve/ISOLATING">
          <Description>Valve that is used to isolate system components.
Note that an isolating valve is constrained to have a 2 port  pattern.</Description>
