            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="0Guz$IdLv0BAWAqr5f3V7r" Name="ShowerType" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Selection of the type of shower from the enumerated list of types where:-

Drench:  	Shower that rapidly gives a thorough soaking in an emergency.
Individual: 	Shower unit that is typically enclosed and is for the use of one person at a time.
Tunnel: 	Shower that has a succession of shower heads or spreaders that operate simultaneously along its length.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="3bWiK$vvPEt91UO_DB5Ref">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Shower Type" Language="en" />
