            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="27KsGuJ7HAzRSORHkcOFE5" Name="InletPatternType" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>Identifies the pattern of inlet connections to a trap.

A trap may have 0,1,2,3 or 4 inlet connections and the pattern of their arrangement may vary. The enumeration makes the convention that an outlet is either vertical or is placed at the bottom (south side) of the trap (when viewed in plan). Position 1 is to the left (west), position 2 is to the top (north), position 3 is to the right (east) and position 4 is to the bottom (south).</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="2kQLbZwvn0mxBQhIUKYYzx">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Inlet Pattern Type" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="12287hbv11uBXrnXfyoGmT">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="吸気口種類" Language="ja-JP">
                    <Description>防臭弁の吸気口接続口の識別情報。

一つの防臭弁に0.1.2.3.4.の吸気口接続口とパターンがあるときは変化する可能性があります。羅列されるとき、接続口が垂直である様子か、防臭弁の底（南）におかれます。位置1は左(西)に、位置2は上方(北)に、位置3は右(東)に、位置4は下方(南）になる。</Description>
                  </RelatingLibrary>
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="1k3NxSdjz0AudCuFAS6VoN">
                  <RelatingLibrary Identification="NONE" Name="None" Language="en" />
                </IfcRelAssociatesLibrary>
