            <IfcPropertyTemplate xsi:type="IfcSimplePropertyTemplate" GlobalId="133Tm0qVKHuO00025QrE$V" Name="DistanceBetweenComponentAxes" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcPositiveLengthMeasure" SecondaryMeasureType="" AccessState="READWRITE">
              <Description>The distance between the axes of the components, measured along the ‘South’ edge of the slab.</Description>
              <HasAssociations>
                <IfcRelAssociatesLibrary GlobalId="0jr3bA1J19pPwITrGwOKFg">
                  <RelatingLibrary Name="Distance Between Component Axes" Language="en" />
